    "tactics": "Lantern Archons support and illuminate rather than fight. They position to maximize their Aura of Courage benefit, report detected threats, and pepper resistant enemies with Light Ray. Against undead they are considerably more dangerous. They will refuse to enter areas where they would be asked to assist with anything they perceive as unjust.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Light Ray [Combat]: Ranged attack (Dex 5 + Ranged Combat 2), Range: 30 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 8 Positive damage (3 + 5 Dex)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 8 Positive damage, DR halved (round up); undead and fiends take double damage</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Continual Flame: Sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius. This light suppresses magical darkness of equal or lower energy cost. Detect Evil: The Archon automatically senses creatures with malicious intent within 60 feet. It communicates this information to the summoner as a [Free] action. Aura of Courage: Allies within 10 feet of the Archon subtract 1 from both dice on saves against the Frightened condition. Diminutive Target: ### Attacks against the Archon add 1 to both dice due to its tiny size.</p>",
